<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Wuffa</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">6th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/6th-century">6th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Wuffa was the semi-legendary founder of the East Anglian royal house, from whom the dynasty took the name <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wuffingas">Wuffingas</a>. Later genealogies make him the grandfather of Rædwald and place his rule in the 6th century, but nothing about him is securely known.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/wuffa.jpg" alt="Wuffa" width="320" height="317" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: John Speed · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Uffa_-_John_Speed.JPG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
